.SH Feature Maturity & Integrator Guide
.P
For a comprehensive status overview and comparison between the public \fBCloud Dashboard (CD) Foundation\fR and the \fBPersonalized Cloud Dashboard (PCD)\fR tier, please refer to:
.P
👉 \fB
.UR ./docs/FEATURE_MATURITY.md
.I Feature Maturity Overview & CD/PCD Architectural Matrix
.UE
\fR
.SS Key Modernization Highlights

.RS 1
.IP \(bu 2
\fBReact 18 & Functional Architecture\fR: Full migration to React 18 hooks (\fBuseState\fP, \fBuseEffect\fP, \fBuseCallback\fP, \fBuseRef\fP) and \fBcreateRoot\fP\|\.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBReact Router v6\fR: Modern declarative routing (\fB<Routes>\fP, \fB<Route element={<\.\.\. />} />\fP) with route\-level analytics\.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRedux 5 & Redux\-Thunk 3\fR: Streamlined state store with async circuit breaker retry loops (\fBisApiHalted\fP) protecting against external API flakiness\.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBDebounced Search\fR: 500ms debounced catalog search component with query sanitization\.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBPublic Repository Sanitization\fR: Zero hardcoded secrets, proprietary endpoints, or private cloud references\. All configuration is externalized via \fB\|\.env\fP\|\.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBPlatformApps Preservation\fR: All \fBPLATFORMAPPS\fP telemetry and mock APIs native to HolimaX remain 100% intact and untouched\.

.RE
.SH Introduction
.P
This project:

.RS 1
.IP \(bu 2
was bootstrapped with 
.UR https://github.com/facebook/create-react-app
.I Create React App
.UE .
.IP \(bu 2
serves as the public open\-source foundation for Cloud Dashboard integrators and Personalized Cloud Dashboard (PCD) customers\.
.IP \(bu 2
was adjusted to include integration with cloud and container technologies (Terraform, Ansible, Kubernetes), documented within respective configuration directories\.

.RE
.P
React\-based Application is kept isolated to ensure overall integrity and transparency\.
